{
  "title": "STOA Labs — Federation (observabilite)",
  "uid": "stoa-fed-overview",
  "tags": [
    "stoa",
    "federation",
    "poc"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "gateway",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Fédération — observabilité unifiée\nUn seul plan d'observabilité (OTel -> Tempo/Prometheus) pour des gateways hétérogènes : **Apache APISIX** (OSS) + **webMethods** (mock legacy) — et **WSO2** quand son exporteur OTel est activé (`scripts/setup-wso2-otel.sh`). Sélecteur `$gateway`. Données synthétiques — institution financière régulée (anonymisé), anonymisé."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requetes/s par gateway (span metrics)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$gateway\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence p95 par gateway",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service,le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=~\"$gateway\"}[5m]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces recentes (Tempo) — toutes gateways",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceqlSearch",
          "filters": [
            {
              "id": "svc",
              "tag": "service.name",
              "operator": "=~",
              "scope": "resource",
              "value": [
                "$gateway"
              ],
              "valueType": "string"
            }
          ],
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "webMethods réel — métriques natives du gateway (sag_apigw_*, scrape :5555/metrics)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "wM — transactions par API",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (api_name) (rate(sag_apigw_api_tx_count[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{api_name}} tx/min"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": "rate() encaisse les remises à zéro du compteur (recycle keepalive ~23 min)."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "wM — erreurs par code (policy/exec/backend)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (code, error) (rate(sag_apigw_api_tx_error_count[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{code}} ({{error}})/min"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (api_name) (rate(sag_apigw_api_backend_error_count[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "backend {{api_name}}/min"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": "Inclut TOUS les 401 (même anonymes/non-preemptive, qui ne génèrent ni trace ni event — cf. ADR-073). Les rejets avec token invalide (preemptive) ont EN PLUS un span Error dans Tempo via le poller PV."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "wM — latence moyenne : gateway vs backend (ms)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg by (api_name) (sag_apigw_api_avg_response_time{code=~\"2xx\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{api_name}} totale"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg by (api_name) (sag_apigw_api_avg_backend_response_time{code=~\"2xx\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{api_name}} backend"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": "Vue du gateway lui-même (complément des span metrics Tempo : ici on voit aussi ce que les traces ne couvrent pas)."
    }
  ]
}